  "body_html": "<h1><em>root</em>.Finset.card_filter_filter_neg</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem _root_.Finset.card_filter_filter_neg {X : Type*} (s : Finset X) (p : X → Prop) [DecidablePred p] : s.card = (Finset.filter p s).card + (Finset.filter (fun (a : X) =&gt; ¬p a) s).card</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>none</li>\n</ul>",
